# The keyboard's GIF panel (Soma 108+). Bugs Boss found 2026-10-22: the handle jittered while pulled; Done emptied
# the search; the handle was gone after a search. The keys are drawn, not labelled, so the checks read what the
# panel logs (`log`), and the screenshots are looked at. Positions are for the Fold profile's cover screen, portrait,
# calibrated on the Fold8 emulator from the 128 walk: the panel's handle at 0.547, its search pill at 0.597; searching,
# the band's handle at 0.327 and its field at 0.36. Typing goes on the keys (adb's text input goes to the app's field).
# A clean start: no shade or dialog left by an earlier walk.
shell cmd statusbar collapse
key BACK
key HOME
ime dev.omalauncher.boss/dev.omalauncher.keyboard.OmaKeyboardService
launch com.android.settings/.Settings
tap Search settings
wait 800
clearlog
# The GIF button: the bottom strip, after the split switch.
tap 0.16 0.965
wait 1200
log gif panel expanded=false query= handle=shown
shot gif-panel
# A short pull, let go: the panel follows the finger a little and settles back (Boss, 2026-10-22: it snapped to the
# top at the first move).
swipe 0.5 0.547 0.5 0.50 700
wait 800
log gif handle settles back
nolog gif expanded=true
shot short-pull-settles-back
clearlog
# The handle pulled up slowly: the panel follows the finger, then stays up (no flicking back and forth).
swipe 0.5 0.547 0.5 0.30 900
wait 800
log gif handle follows
log gif expanded=true
nolog gif expanded=false
shot expanded-after-pull
# And down again, from the expanded panel's handle (about 0.066 of the height under the 110 px status bar of the phone and, since 2026-10-23, the emulator; it was 0.095 under the emulator's old 152 px one).
swipe 0.5 0.066 0.5 0.6 900
wait 800
log gif expanded=false
shot collapsed-after-pull
# Search, then Done: the words stay in the field, and the handle is there.
tap 0.4 0.597
wait 600
log gif band query= handle=shown
# c, a, t on the keys, then done.
tap 0.40 0.818
tap 0.105 0.747
tap 0.45 0.675
wait 1200
log gif band query=cat handle=shown
tap 0.905 0.89
wait 1500
log gif panel expanded=false query=cat handle=shown
shot results-keep-cat-and-handle
# Searching again starts from those words; the band's handle pulled up opens the results full screen.
tap 0.4 0.597
wait 800
log gif band query=cat handle=shown
swipe 0.5 0.327 0.5 0.10 600
wait 800
log gif panel expanded=true query=cat handle=shown
shot band-handle-pulled-full-screen
[phone] On the cover screen and unfolded: drag the GIF handle up and down slowly; the panel's top stays under the finger, a short pull let go goes back, a long one or a flick goes on.
[phone] The pull is smooth, no stutter, on both screens (Boss, 2026-10-22: it stuttered in 129).
[phone] Search a word, tap Done: the word stays in the field, the handle shows; ✕ beside the arrow goes back to Trending.
[phone] Tap a GIF in a real chat app: it lands in the message box.
